---
import PresentationLayout from "@pres/components/PresentationLayout.astro";
import highSpeedTrainOldCoach from "./assets/svg/high-speed-train-old-coach.svg";
---

<PresentationLayout
  eyebrow="国家队的盘外招 · 其一"
  title="消化不良资产"
  narrow
>
  <div class="root">
    <div class="visualRow">
      <article class="assetCard legacyCard">
        <p class="assetRole">被注入的低效资产</p>
        <h2>太原局普速客货运线路</h2>
        <p>南同蒲、北同蒲等 7 条干线 + 5 条支线，设备老化、运力饱和，公益性普速客运常年亏损。</p>
      </article>

      <div class="trainVisual">
        <img src={highSpeedTrainOldCoach.src} alt="A modern high-speed locomotive hauling open-top wagons filled with scrap" class="svg" />
      </div>

      <article class="assetCard coreCard">
        <p class="assetRole">原有核心资产</p>
        <h2>大秦线</h2>
        <p>全球最暴利的重载煤运专线，现金流长期稳定充沛，是上市公司的“现金奶牛”。</p>
      </article>
    </div>

    <section class="eventSummary" aria-labelledby="event-title">
      <h2 id="event-title">事件始末</h2>
      <p>2009 年 11 月，大秦铁路抛出定增方案：拟募资约 165 亿元，整体作价约 328 亿元，反向收购控股股东太原铁路局的运输主业资产——包括 7 条干线、5 条支线及朔黄铁路 41.6% 股权，2010 年获批完成注入。散户痛斥这是“用黄金换垃圾”：优质大秦线的 ROE 与分红，从此被常年亏损的公益客运和低效支线稀释；但在国资绝对控股下，方案依然强行通过。</p>
    </section>
  </div>
</PresentationLayout>

<style>
  .root {
    height: 100%;
    min-height: 0;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 1rem;
    padding-bottom: 0.75rem;
  }

  .visualRow {
    flex: 1 1 0;
    min-height: 0;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) minmax(0, 2.2fr) minmax(0, 1fr);
    align-items: center;
    gap: 1rem;
  }

  .assetCard {
    padding: 1.1rem 1.15rem;
    border-left: 4px solid;
  }

  .legacyCard {
    background: #fff7ed;
    border-left-color: #ea580c;
  }

  .legacyCard .assetRole {
    color: #9a3412;
  }

  .coreCard {
    background: #eff6ff;
    border-left-color: #2563eb;
  }

  .coreCard .assetRole {
    color: #1d4ed8;
  }

  .assetRole {
    margin: 0 0 0.55rem;
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
  }

  .assetCard h2 {
    margin: 0;
    color: #263445;
    font-size: 1.2rem;
    line-height: 1.35;
  }

  .assetCard p:last-child {
    margin: 0.55rem 0 0;
    color: #4b5563;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    line-height: 1.55;
  }

  .trainVisual {
    height: 100%;
    min-width: 0;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
  }

  .svg {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    max-height: 100%;
    object-fit: contain;
  }

  .eventSummary {
    flex: 0 0 auto;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 11rem minmax(0, 1fr);
    align-items: start;
    gap: 1.2rem;
    margin: 0.5rem auto 0;
    padding: 1rem 1.4rem 0;
    border-top: 1px solid #dbe2e8;
    max-width: 66rem;
  }

  .eventSummary h2 {
    margin: 0;
    color: #334155;
    font-size: 1rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  .eventSummary p {
    margin: 0;
    color: #475569;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    line-height: 1.7;
  }
</style>
